<title>UK: Ford Credit Europe sets 10 bln GRD March 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Credit Europe sets 10 bln GRD March 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD CREDIT EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN GRD    COUPON     9.45	MATURITY    01.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.481   PAY DATE  S-28.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    101.106   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (M) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		10 BILLION GREEK DRACHMA = ($34.4 million)</p>
<p>	   ($ = 290.7 Greek Drachmas)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
